body.p:
Suppose that you need to change the font of MathML equations from the
      documentation, if the equations are wrapped in
        equation-block/equation-inline you can
      match them using the
        equation-d/equation-block/equation-d/equation-inline
      classes:*[class ~= "equation-d/equation-block"],
*[class ~= "equation-d/equation-inline"] {
  font-family: "Courier New";
  font-size: 1.5em;
}

You can also directly match the equation itself, in this case the rule
      becomes:*[class ~= "mathml-d/mathml"] {
  font-family: "STIX Two Math", "Courier New";
}
